    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Annette Balfe Dublin Homes Auctioneers is pleased to present 12 Park Gate, Verdemont, Blanchardstown, a 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom second-floor apartment ideally positioned within the sought-after Verdemont development, just moments from Blanchardstown Centre. This bright and spacious apartment offers modern apartment living in a highly convenient location with excellent transport links and local amenities on the doorstep.\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of an entrance hallway, a generous open-plan living and dining area, fully fitted kitchen, two spacious double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes, master ensuite, and a main family bathroom. The property further benefits from a private balcony, double-glazed windows, electric storage heating, and communal parking.\r\nPark Gate forms part of the established Verdemont development off Snugborough Road, within walking distance of shops, cafés, restaurants, leisure facilities, schools, and business parks. Coolmine railway station and multiple Dublin Bus routes provide excellent public transport access, while the N3 and M50 are only minutes away, connecting to Dublin City Centre and Dublin Airport."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Room Measurements:\r\nHallway - 1.85m x 3.84m\r\nLiving Room - 4.58m x 5.27m\r\nDining Area - 2.36m x 3.27m\r\nKitchen - 2.26m x 2.99m\r\nMaster Bedroom - 4.73m x 2.73m\r\nEnsuite - 1.73m x 1.67m\r\nSecond Bedroom - 3.05m x 2.55m\r\nMain Bathroom - 1.80m x 2.34m\r\nBalcony - 1.57m x 6.37m\r\n\r\nPlease note all measurements and floor plans are approximate and provided for guidance only\r\nAll information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases, some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. While every care is taken in preparing particulars Dublin Homes Auctioneers do not hold themselves responsible for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each viewer the right to get a professional opinion on any concerns they may have."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Walking distance to Blanchardstown Centre\r\nEasy access to N3, M50 & Dublin Airport\r\nClose to Coolmine Train Station and Dublin Bus routes\r\nBright open-plan layout\r\nEnsuite master bedroom\r\nPrivate balcony overlooking communal areas\r\nDouble-glazed windows"
      },
      {
